<section class="ac-character-creator"><h2>Create DHF</h2><p>This creates the 2020 rules chassis, rolls sleeve Health, applies Archetype resource modifiers, embeds all 32 starting Skill levels, optionally applies a published Starting Package, and rolls age-based Baggage.</p><div class="form-group"><label>Name</label><input name="name" value="New DHF"></div><div class="form-group"><label>Archetype</label><select name="archetype">{{#each archetypes}}<option value="{{this}}">{{this}}</option>{{/each}}</select></div><div class="form-group"><label>Starting Package</label><select name="package"><option value="">Custom / choose later</option>{{#each packageOptions}}<option value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></div><div class="form-group"><label>Variant</label><select name="variant"><option value="standard">Standard</option><option value="ai">AI</option><option value="religious">Religious Coding</option><option value="envoy">Envoy</option><option value="meth">Meth</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label>DHF age</label><input type="number" name="age" value="30" min="18"><p class="muted">Ignored for AI, which has no DHF age.</p></div><div class="form-group"><label>AI Stack Points override</label><input type="number" name="manualSP" value="" min="0"><p class="muted">Required for AI because the 2020 Core gives no age-based starting SP row for AI.</p></div><div class="form-group"><label>AI Influence Points override</label><input type="number" name="manualIP" value="" min="0"><p class="muted">Required for AI for the same reason; no value is silently invented.</p></div><div class="form-group"><label>Wealth (defaults to Archetype if left blank)</label><input type="number" name="wealth" value="" min="0" max="6"></div><div class="form-group"><label>Sleeve type</label><select name="sleeveType">{{#each sleeveTypes}}<option value="{{this}}">{{this}}</option>{{/each}}</select></div><h3>Attributes</h3><p class="muted">Stack Attributes begin at 30. Higher values here are supported for pregenerated/GM-authored characters; normal advancement spends SP and rolls d4 increases.</p><div class="attributes"><label>Strength <input type="number" name="strength" value="30"></label><label>Perception <input type="number" name="perception" value="30"></label><label>Empathy <input type="number" name="empathy" value="30"></label><label>Willpower <input type="number" name="willpower" value="30"></label><label>Acuity <input type="number" name="acuity" value="30"></label><label>Intelligence <input type="number" name="intelligence" value="30"></label></div><button type="button" data-action="create"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i> Create Character</button></section>
